        <entry><link xlink:href="https://documentation.suse.com/sbp/sap-15/html/SLES4SAP-hana-scaleout-multitarget-perfopt-15/index.html#id-implementing-sustkover-py-for-pretakeover">Not mandatory but recommended</link></entry>
      </row>
      <row>
